      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We describe a 41-year-old woman with a short history of retrosternal chest pain and non-productive cough due to a benign intrapulmonary teratoma originating from the left upper lobe. The clinical, CT features of this rare tumor are presented and the relevant literature is discussed."},
